  "url": "https://www.garvee.com/pages/warranty-policy",
  "title": "Warranty Policy - GARVEE",
  "text": "Get 10% OFF First Buy + Points on Every Order\n\nJoin Free\n\nEnjoy 10% OFF Member Pricing\n\nGet My Discount\n\nMember Pricing：10% OFF + $20\n\nUnlock Savings\n\nGet 10% OFF First Buy + Points on Every Order\n\nJoin Free\nUnited States ( USD$ ) / English\nCustomer Service\nWelcome\nSign-in Reward: 10% OFF\nCategories\nNew Arrivals\nBest Sellers🔥\nFlash Deals⚡\nClearance\nDIY Projects & Ideas\nAbout Us\nRewards & Points\nFree Us Shipping\n30 Day No-Hassle Returns\n12-Month Warranty\nWelcome\nSign-in Reward:10% OFF\nNew Arrivals\nBest Sellers🔥\nFlash Deals⚡\nClearance\nDIY Projects & Ideas\nTrending Now\nEverything You Need to Know About Rug Sizes and Placement\nFind the Right One for Your Business Needs\nBuying Guides\nPower Tools Vs. Hand Tools: What You Need to Know\nEverything You Should Know About Wine Cooler\nHow Tos\nDifference Between a Dresser and a Chest of Drawers\nCheap Home Improvement Ideas Boost Your Home's Value\nAbout Us\nRewards & Points\nUnited States ( USD$ ) / English\nSelect Your Country/Region\nUnited Kingdom( GBP£ )\nEnglish\nUnited States( USD$ )\nEnglish\nCanada( CAD$ )\nEnglish\nDeutschland( EUR€ )\nDeutsch\nEspaña( EUR€ )\nEspañol\nFrance( EUR€ )\nFrançais\nItalia( EUR€ )\nItaliano\nHome\nWarranty Policy\nWarranty Policy\n\n \n\nWarranty Period\n\n\nGARVEE provides a 12-month repair warranty against defects in quality for all products purchased from garvee.com. This warranty period commences from the day the package is received by the customer.\nThe Warranty provided covers the original purchaser and is valid for a period of 12 months, as evidenced by the original purchase receipt or other acceptable proof of purchase.\n\nWarranty Coverage\n\n\nOur Warranty covers the following:\n\nDefects in materials and workmanship under normal use and service.\nFaults that occur despite proper usage and care in accordance with our product instructions.\n\n\nThis Warranty does not cover the following:\n\nNormal wear and tear or aging of the product,does not affect the fuction, such as damage to the appearance. We provide free replacement on product accessories within 30 days after delivery.\nDamage resulting from misuse, neglect, accidents, impact, water damage, or unauthorized modifications or repairs.\nCosmetic damage that does not affect the functionality of the product.\nLoss or theft of the product.\nOther reasons not caused by our fault\n\n\nMaking a Claim\n\nTo make a warranty claim, please follow these steps:\nContact our customer service team email: support@garvee.com with a detailed description of the issue and evidence of the defect (e.g., photos or videos).\n\nProvide the original purchase receipt or other acceptable proof of purchase.\nFollow the instructions provided by our customer service team for returning the product, if required.\nWe will repair, replace, or refund, at our discretion, any product found to be covered by our Warranty.\n\n\nLimitation of Liability\n\n\nTo the fullest extent permitted by law, our liability is limited to the purchase price of the product. We are not responsible for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages, including but not limited to loss of profits, revenue, or data, resulting from any breach of this warranty.\n\nGoverning Law\n\n\nThese Warranty terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which our business is established, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.\n\nChanges to the Warranty Terms\n\n\nWe reserve the right to change these Warranty terms at any time without prior notice. Such changes will not affect warranties issued prior to the date of the change.\n\n\n\nHow should the warranty be executed？\n\n \n\nStep 1: Please email to our customer service via support@garvee.com and provide the reason and the necessary pictures or videos to verify your order issue.\n\nStep 2: After receiving your request, our customer service team will investigate and provide a solution according to our warranty policy.\n\nStep 3: GARVEE after-sale service team, after evaluating the details you provide, will offer a resolution. Once an agreement is reached through mutual communication and a return is necessary, our support team will provide you with the return information (please do not send your return to the sender's address listed on the package).\n\nStep 4: The customer return the product as per our instructions in 30 days(if required). When our warehouse receives the return, Confirmed the order after inspection, our customer service team will operate the repair.\n\nStep 5: Once the repair is completed, Garvee customer service team will proactively contact the customer via email or phone to arrange the return of the product. \n\nOur Returning Address: 14650 Levey Lane, Houston, TX 77047\n\n\n\nCustomer Service Contact Information\n\n\nFor any questions regarding this Warranty or to make a claim, please contact our customer service team at:\nSupport Email: support@garvee.com\nCustomer Phone Service: +1 888 891 2855\n\nYour satisfaction is our priority. We strive to provide quality products and exceptional service to all our customers. This Warranty is our promise to stand behind the products we sell and to support you in the event of any issues.\n\nGarvee Info\nAbout Garvee\nSpecial Outlets\nDIY Projects & Ideas\nTerms Of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCustomer Service\nTrack Your Order\nPayments Policy\nShipping Policy\nWarranty Policy\nRefund & Return Policy\nWorry-Free Purchase\nContact Us\nPartner & Program\nAffiliate Program\nInfluencer Program\nShare and Win\nGarvee Rewards\nProtection Plans\nHelp Center\nWholeSale Program\nSubscribe Now\n\nJoin the Club & Get $10+5% Off\n\nAwards\n© 2026 GARVEE All rights reserved.",
